# BAWAAL Arena Challenge Architecture (LOCKED baseline)

High-performance stealth-black sports network centered on **asynchronous 1v1 video battles**.
Do not regress: single cinematic Arena feed, shelf at index 2+, slim GAME ON hub, BATTLES open callouts, locked `BAWAAL_SPORTS`, 1-tap challenge camera, or 200ms post-record teardown.

## Navigation hubs

| Hub | Role |
|---|---|
| **ARENA** | Clean single-stream video feed. Header **ARENA** + **GAME ON**. Inline **LIVE COMMUNITY CHALLENGES** shelf at index **2+** only. |
| **GAME ON** | Live scores + `BAWAAL_SPORTS` pills only (`GameOnHub` / `ScoresSportsPanel`). |
| **BATTLES** | Active battles + Open Callouts (**OPEN CHALLENGES** \| **TIPS & BREAKDOWNS**). |

## Immutable sports taxonomy

Source: `src/constants/sports.js` → `BAWAAL_SPORTS`  
Order: ALL → CRICKET → FOOTBALL → GYM → KABADDI → COMBAT → THROTTLE → WAVE & BLADE → COURT KINGS → SKY & SUMMIT → OTHERS.  
No local sport arrays. No Tennis/Badminton/etc. fallbacks in GAME ON.

## Feed & startup

- Indices **0** and **1** are always video/battle media (`MIN_MEDIA_BEFORE_SHELF = 2`).
- Shelf every **4** media rows after that (`COMMUNITY_SHELF_INTERVAL = 4`).
- Shelf deep-links via `openBattlesCallout(id)`.

## Challenge camera (1-tap)

- `+ BATTLE` / Battles LAUNCH → `UniversalCamera` challenge mode immediately.
- Keep **`RECORDING_TEARDOWN_MS = 200`** before preview/unmount.

## Re-hydration prompt

Load project context for BAWAAL: Navigation hubs are ARENA (cinematic feed + shelf at index 2+), GAME ON (scores + BAWAAL_SPORTS pills only), and BATTLES (OPEN CHALLENGES | TIPS & BREAKDOWNS). BAWAAL_SPORTS in src/constants/sports.js is the immutable taxonomy. Keep 1-tap UniversalCamera challenge creation and the 200ms recording teardown delay.

